# LF everywhere, in the repo and in every checkout. This project's own trap list
# records that a line-ending flip has cost it real time ("A text-mode python write
# flips the whole file LF->CRLF"), and Git for Windows defaults core.autocrlf to
# true, which would hand a fresh clone CRLF copies of files the working tree keeps
# as LF. core.autocrlf is also set false locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.glb binary
*.wasm binary
*.pfx binary
